      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "collection-class",
          "nodeId": "collection"
        },
        "markdown": "A collection is a graph that presents other graphs. A member is a graph the collection contains through a portal and a `contains` edge from its `members` port; everything else in the graph is an ordinary node.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `body`, `sort`.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "A collection is a graph that presents other graphs. A member is a graph the collection contains through a portal and a `contains` edge from its `members` port; everything else in the graph is an ordinary node.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `body`, `sort`."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
